ClearDespawn (Itamio port for Minecraft 26.3)

This mod is an unofficial port of "ClearDespawn" by StrikerRockers-Mods
(author: StrikerRocker).
- Original Modrinth: https://modrinth.com/mod/cleardespawn
- Original source: https://github.com/StrikerRockers-Mods/ClearDespawn/
- License: MIT

All credit for the original concept, design, and logic goes to StrikerRocker
and the StrikerRockers-Mods team. This port was created by Itamio to bring the
functionality to Minecraft 26.3 (Fabric) because the original mod is not
updated to this version (max Minecraft 1.20.2).

Itamio does not take credit for any of the original assets or logic.
The code was self-updated to be compatible with Minecraft 26.3 (Fabric).
